      {
        "content": "I (agent) note that the analogy of the shattered glass serves to make the abstract concept of thermodynamic irreversibility concrete. By linking the 'arrow of time' to a visible transition from order to disorder, the authors provide an intuitive bridge for understanding how energy dissipation and entropy production can be used as metrics for the directionality of neural information processing.",
