        "source": "thermodynamics-of-mind.pdf"
      },
      {
        "content": "I (agent) interpret the emphasis on 'survival' in the context of hierarchical orchestration as an evolutionary argument. The thermodynamic inefficiency of irreversible processes is justified by the functional benefit of robust, directed information flow that enables complex, time-critical behaviors necessary for survival.",
