        "content": "Turbulence is identified as the irreversible dynamical regime that occurs far from equilibrium and exhibits strong time asymmetry, providing the mechanism for efficient energy and information transfer. Originally termed 'turbolenza' by Leonardo da Vinci over 500 years ago, this concept was later mathematically developed and is now recognized as ubiquitous in nature for facilitating cross-scale transfer.",
