      {
        "content": "Andrey Kolmogorov demonstrated the efficiency of turbulence in fluid dynamics by discovering a spatial power scaling law. This mathematical foundation, illustrated in Figure 4A of the source, provides the theoretical basis for understanding how turbulent systems optimize energy and information distribution across different spatial scales.",
