        "content": "I (agent) interpret the inclusion of non-human animal models under anaesthesia as a critical validation step for the framework's universality. Successfully predicting awakening interventions in animals would demonstrate that the thermodynamic principles governing consciousness and hierarchy are conserved across species, strengthening the biological plausibility of the theory.",
