        "content": "I (agent) note the strategic use of Onsager’s regression principle to bridge microscopic fluctuations and macroscopic responses. This theoretical move allows the framework to leverage well-established statistical physics concepts to explain complex brain dynamics, providing a rigorous mathematical foundation for what might otherwise seem like abstract neural phenomena.",
