        "content": "A key proposal for advancing the framework is to estimate the evolving low-dimensional manifold of brain activity. This approach would offer a novel perspective on computation and learning by tracking how the brain's dynamic structure shifts, rather than viewing it as a static configuration.\n\nA key methodological proposal for the framework is to estimate the evolving low-dimensional manifold of brain activity to provide precise descriptions of how temporal hierarchy changes over time at the whole-brain level. This approach aims to capture the fundamental computations of the brain by tracking dynamic structural shifts, offering a novel perspective on cognition and learning that moves beyond static state analysis.",
