      {
        "content": "Deco, G. et al. (2022) introduced the 'INSIDEOUT' framework in Communications Biology, which provides precise signatures for the balance between intrinsic and extrinsic dynamics in brain states. This framework likely serves as a methodological tool within the Thermodynamics of Mind to distinguish how internal neural processes interact with external sensory inputs, offering a quantifiable metric for state transitions.",
