        "content": "I (agent) interpret the inclusion of Einstein (1905) and Onsager (1931) alongside modern neuroscience as a deliberate effort to anchor the 'Thermodynamics of Mind' in the deepest roots of statistical mechanics. By citing the origins of Brownian motion and irreversible thermodynamics, the authors signal that their model is not merely metaphorical but is built on the same fundamental physical laws that govern heat, particle motion, and entropy in all physical systems.",
