      {
        "content": "Deco, G. et al. (2023) published 'Violations of the fluctuation-dissipation theorem reveal distinct non-equilibrium dynamics of brain states' in Physical Review E. This work uses the violation of the fluctuation-dissipation theorem as a specific marker to distinguish between different brain states, reinforcing the view that the brain operates as a non-equilibrium system where standard equilibrium statistical mechanics do not fully apply.",
