      {
        "content": "Cross, M.C. and Hohenberg, P.C. (1993) authored the seminal review 'Pattern formation outside of equilibrium' in Reviews of Modern Physics. This reference provides the theoretical foundation for understanding how complex spatial and temporal patterns emerge in systems far from thermodynamic equilibrium, which is directly applicable to modeling the self-organized patterns of neural activity.",
