        "source": "thermodynamics-of-mind.pdf"
      },
      {
        "content": "The 'Thermodynamics of Mind' framework utilizes key concepts such as irreversibility and the 'arrow of time' to reveal the asymmetry of brain information flow. These concepts allow researchers to measure the directionality and efficiency of information processing within neural networks.",
