        "source": "thermodynamics-of-mind.pdf"
      },
      {
        "content": "Morten L. Kringelbach is affiliated with the Centre for Eudaimonia and Human Flourishing at Linacre College, University of Oxford, and the Department of Psychiatry at the University of Oxford. He is also associated with the Center for Music in the Brain at the Department of Clinical Medicine, Aarhus University, and the International Centre for Flourishing involving the Universities of Oxford, Aarhus, and Pompeu Fabra.",
